==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
Old Norse

===Verb===
'''falla''' ([[fell]]; [[féll]], [[féllu]], [[fallið]])

# to [[fall]]
# to be [[killed]] in battle or action
# to [[flow]]
# to fit [[closely]], to shut tight, to meet
# to [[like]]

